# Vocabulary Hub contents for the fair2grow scenario.
#
# A Semantic Treehouse catalogue export (project "DigiLab TK FAIR2Grow") of a local STH,
# produced by sth-greenhouse-bundle/fair2grow/tools/sth_publish.py. It holds the WUR logical
# model (MIM level 3) of the Greenhouse Data Platform, the message model derived from SAREF4AGRI
# and SOSA, the two codelists, the five ontologies, and the element and value alignments.
# The STH export is unedited. Two things STH cannot export are appended by hand at the end:
# the coverage of the alignments, and the Frictionless binding (MIM level 4) of the WUR model.
# Refresh the export from tno.semantic-treehouse.nl once the specifications are published there;
# the IRIs then change from localhost:4200 to that host, so update the appended part too.

